A command line interface for Semaphore operations.

Usage:
  semaphore-cli [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  config      Validate and print the version 2 bootstrap file of the relay proxy
  evaluate    ⚙️ Evaluate feature flags based on configuration and context
  generate    🏗️ Generate Semaphore related files
  help        Help about any command
  lint        🛑 Lint Semaphore configuration file.
  publish     Publish flag files and flag-set documents to S3 behind a manifest

Flags:
  -h, --help[=true|false]      help for semaphore-cli
  -v, --version[=true|false]   version for semaphore-cli

Use "semaphore-cli [command] --help" for more information about a command.
